  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development organic pineapple value chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fifty smallholder pineapple growers, located on the Nyapinda farms in Zimbabwe, are united, trained and certified organically. Indigenous farmers are actively engaged in this process, as they are empowered and encouraged to adopt organic farming methods that do not harm the ecological system.Valuable insights gained from this initiative are then shared with policymakers and interested companies to promote sustainable export of horticultural products from Zimbabwe to the Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
